@tradition gerald-clinic
// Gerald clinic (FX14, 0.92.5 item 16; SW1's pitch): every cactus on the Wren is called Gerald, and they all came from Tove
// Cruz's cuttings. Every other Sunday she holds a clinic at the garden's potting bench end. Behind WEEKEND_ON.
k: 465
title: Gerald clinic
when: every 2 weeks sunday week 2 from day 1
at: 14:30-15:15
min: 20
jitter: 10
where: 3 pool garden
hold: 1
who: cruz-tove always, janssen-hugo always, esposito-yara always, alvarez-luca always, walsh-esme always, gardener 50%, garden-lover 30%, everyone 5%
anim: water
host: cruz-tove
from: cruz-tove

== mail
- Gerald clinic tomorrow at half two. Bring your Gerald. Mm. Or come and get one. They're very easy. Mostly.

== ask
- Gerald clinic later. Mine needs a repot. Don't tell him.   #funny
- Bring your Gerald to the garden this afternoon? Cruz is looking them over.

== here
- Mm. A little water. Not too much. Gerald doesn't like a fuss.
- That one's a cutting of a cutting of the first Gerald.

== thanks
- You line up with the Gerald keepers at the potting bench while Tove Cruz murmurs to each little cactus in turn.

== chatter
- Gerald clinic tomorrow. My Gerald's leaning. Cruz says he's just thinking.   #funny
